# DESIGN.md agent

The repository follows the [DESIGN.md](https://github.com/google-labs-code/design.md) format: YAML front matter holds **normative** design tokens; markdown sections explain **how** to apply them.

When building or changing UI:

1. Read `DESIGN.md` at the repo root before picking colors, type scales, radii, or component chrome.
2. Treat token values in front matter as authoritative; prose explains intent and composition rules.
3. After editing `DESIGN.md`, run `npm run design:lint` and fix reported errors.
4. To emit machine-readable tokens, use `npm run design:export-tailwind` (Tailwind theme JSON) or `npm run design:export-dtcg` (Design Tokens Format) and wire outputs into your build pipeline.

The CLI is provided by the dev dependency `@google/design.md`; npm scripts invoke the `design.md` CLI from `package.json`.
